* **Set C — benzene/air laminar flame speeds**: 1 dataset / 10 points
  (ReSpecTh `4733950`, Ji *et al.* 2012), 1 atm, T₀ = 353 K, φ = 0.7–1.5.
  These conditions are outside the 401-case matrix and were run **after** the
  mechanisms were frozen, as an out-of-sample flame check (§4.4).  File
  `cases/cases_flame_exp.json`.
* **Set D — multi-fuel archive flame speeds**: 7 datasets / 70 points (H₂ 53,
  benzene 10, CH₄ 7) at 1 atm, T₀ = 298–413 K, compositions taken verbatim from
  the ReSpecTh records; every species of each mixture exists in USC-II, and all
  conditions lie outside the 401-case matrix (§4.5, `src/lbv.py`).  File
